{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing a relentless serial killer, you wake up in a hospital you've never seen before. Your body bears a grievous wound that will kill you in fifteen minutes if you do nothing. Yet even in death, you rise again, carrying the memories of everything you've endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/7da89b330f4466425fd5ee1fd4e17775.poster.avif?t=1767966601\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/7da89b330f4466425fd5ee1fd4e17775.webm?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/7da89b330f4466425fd5ee1fd4e17775.mp4?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience, adapt, and survive the time loop in this third-person survival horror -\u00a0<strong>Fear the Timeloop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/4d2573674b9aa80349b474fc990ffbc0.poster.avif?t=1767966601\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/4d2573674b9aa80349b474fc990ffbc0.webm?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/4d2573674b9aa80349b474fc990ffbc0.mp4?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite your critical condition, you must face an even greater threat: bloodthirsty monsters. The hospital is surrounded by mysterious figures, ready to kill anyone who steps outside.  <br> <br>The only person who can help you is Sheriff\u2019s deputy Rose Watters. But neither she nor you know what horrors lurk in the dark corners of Saint Heritage Hospital - or which memories from the past might come rushing back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/0d46b291e0c2d051e54042c79100992f.poster.avif?t=1767966601\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/0d46b291e0c2d051e54042c79100992f.webm?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/extras/0d46b291e0c2d051e54042c79100992f.mp4?t=1767966601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A time loop at the core of both story and gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flexible ability system that can be tailored to your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system that reacts to your early choices and the path you take through the loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania-inspired elements that let you revisit previously inaccessible areas to unlock new abilities and discover valuable items.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2918090?t=1767966601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918090/ec9b7bf194bad65d50239cb6aa6573940dec08a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767966601","capsule_image":"h